ul-rises#:~:text=The%20cathars%20shifted%20in,one%20arm%20after%20another.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Emrakul Rises\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Jun 2016."}},{"id":"emrakul-rises-e6","era":null,"summary":"Maeli prays to Avacyn, who is dead, for help.","participants":["maeli","avacyn"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"minor","page":"stories/emrakul-rises","order":515,"story_date":"2016-06-22","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":18,"quote":"PLEASE, AVACYN! HELP ME!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/emrakul-rises#:~:text=PLEASE%2C%20AVACYN%21%20HELP%20ME%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Emrakul Rises","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-06-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/emrakul-rises","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/emrakul-rises#:~:text=PLEASE%2C%20AVACYN%21%20HELP%20ME%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Emrakul Rises\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Jun 2016."}},{"id":"emrakul-rises-e7","era":null,"summary":"A mad angel announces that Emrakul is rising and dives at Maeli.","participants":["maeli","emrakul"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/emrakul-rises","order":515,"story_date":"2016-06-22","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":22,"quote":"She dove down, her blade slicing through the air ahead of her.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/emrakul-rises#:~:text=She%20dove%20down%2C%20her,air%20ahead%20of%20her.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Emrakul Rises","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-06-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/emrakul-rises","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/emrakul-rises#:~:text=She%20dove%20down%2C